
## MVP FLOW (convert pdf to podcast)

1. Receive document from telegram
2. Download pdf from telegram
3. Extract text from pdf
4. Clean text
5. Split into chunks 
6. Summarize each chuncks using ai (cheap ai)
7. Create a final summary
8. Convert to podcast script
9. Convert script to ausio TTS.
10. Send result back to telegram.
 

##  Workers Distribution

1. PDF ingestion worker
    - download file
    - store in cloud
    - create db record
    - send extraction job

2. PDF extraction worker
3. Cleaning and structuring worker
    - Removing aheaders and footers
    - normalize text
    - split into sections
4. Summarization worker
5. Final summary merge
6. Podcast script generation
7. text to Speech generation



## DATA MODELS 

```
users
    - id
    - telegram_id
    - plans
    - credits

uploads
    - id 
    - user_id
    - path
    - status
    - summary
    - script
    - audio_url

jobs:
    - id
    - pdf_id
    - stage
    - status
```


## Packages

* telegraf
* axios
* dotenv
* express
* bullmq
* ioredis
* mongoose
* pdf-parse (or pdfjs-dist)
* openai
* cors 
* helmet
* 


## File structure

```
pdf-ai-bot/
    bot/        → Telegram bot (Telegraf)
    api/        → backend orchestration (Express/Fastify)
    workers/    → BullMQ background processors

  packages/
    shared/     → types, utils, chunking, logging
    ai/         → OpenAI + Gemini abstraction layer
    pdf/        → PDF extraction utilities
    storage/    → S3/R2 file handling
    db/         → MongoDB (Mongoose)

  infra/
    docker/

```



